$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General coupling procedure A mixture of
bromothiophene derivatives (0.5mmol), PdCl2(PPh5)2 (0.025mmol) and
FcSnBu3 (0.55mmol) in 4ml of dry DMF was stirred at 120-130 °C for the
time given in the table. Then the mixture was cooled to room temperature,
8ml water was added into it, then extracted with ether, washed with
saturated KF solution and water, dried over MgSO4 and finally
chromatographed on silica gel (eluant: petroleum/acetone) to give desired
products. 3f, yield 95%. 1H NMR δ 7.6-7.15(m, 3H), 4.67(m, 1H), 4.57(m,
1H), 4.31(m, 2H), 4.08(s, 5H); IR: 3092, 1599, 1549, 1514, 1450, 1101,
999; MS m/z 268(M+, 90.5%).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Palladium-catalyzed Stille coupling for the preparation of ferrocenyl
thiophene derivatives
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
