$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 2,5-Bis(3,4-dibutyl-2,2'-bithien-5-yl)selenophene (12a): In a Schlenk
tube and under argon, 2,5-bis(3,4-dibutyl-5-iodothien-2-yl)selenophene 9
(1.41 g, 1.84 mmol) and 2-(tributylstannyl)thiophene 10 (2.76 g, 7.18
mmol) were dissolved in dry degassed THF (20 mL). Pd(PPh3)2Cl2 (51.5 mg,
73.5 μmol, 4 mol %) and cesium fluoride (550 mg, 3.62 mmol) were added,
and the solution was degassed and stirred at 75 °C for 90 h. THF was
evaporated, water (50 mL) was added, and the mixture was extracted with
DCM (3 x 50 mL). The combined organic phases were washed with water (50
mL) and dried over Na2SO4 and the solvent was removed. The crude product
was purified by column chromatography (flash silica, hexane/DCM 9:1). The
pure product was obtained. Orange solid, 1.18 g, 1.73 mmol, 94%. mp 102
°C. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ = 7.32 (d, 3J = 5.2 Hz, 2H, Th-H), 7.25 (s,
2H, Se-H), 7.15 (d, 4J = 2.8 Hz, 2H, Th-H), 7.07 (dd, 3J = 5.2 Hz, 4J =
3.6 Hz, 2H, Th-H), 2.75-2.68 (m, 8H, α-Bu), 1.63-1.39 (m, 16H, β-Bu +
γ-Bu), 0.98 (t, 3J = 7.2 Hz, 6H, δ-Bu), 0.96 (t, 3J = 7.6 Hz, 6H, δ-Bu).
13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ = 140.93, 140.20, 139.74, 136.10, 132.10,
129.84, 127.90, 127.36, 125.83, 125.31, 33.01, 32.90, 28.11, 27.84,
23.10, 23.00, 13.90, 13.87. MS (MALDI-TOF) m/z [M+] = 684.2 (calcd for
C36H44S4Se, 684.15). Anal. Calcd for C36H44S4Se: C, 63.22; H, 6.48; S,
18.75. Found: C, 63.34; H, 6.37; S, 18.63.
